        • Aggressive Scans: -A for a comprehensive scan.
        • Stealth and Timing Options: -T<0-5>, -Pn for stealth scans.
        • Additional Options: --script <script_name>, --traceroute, -v, etc.

        Target (target): Always include the target in the target parameter.

